# tally 2.2.1 P50 N7a (E §3.1 step 9): per world: a scenario's moves line that makes the replaced
# row's version cover the day refuses that scenario (review g4 s223cut/world). Before W13: loads, q_sc 1 000.00 PLN.
=== base.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place shop: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input bank: observed

version open
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

version stmt
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-03-20
  covers konto
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-03-10, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to shop amount 50.00 PLN) "a"

version fix
  cite s
  governs 2026-02
  known 2026-04-01
  replace bank[r1] = (on: 2026-02-10, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to shop amount 70.00 PLN) "day and amount fixed"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-04-30)
=== sc.tally
scenario sc over t
  tally 2
  from 2026-01-01

version widen
  cite s
  governs 2026-02
  known 2026-04-05
  moves stmt to 2026-02..2026-03

ask q_sc: bal(konto, 2026-04-30) in sc
=== expect
scenario sc: refused: LOAD-COVERS replace bank[r1] of konto: fix doesn't cover konto on 2026-02-10 (base.tally:30)
q: 930.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-30
